ice delivery for this awesome game. Stunning gameplay and an awesome soundtrack. Will you survive?\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Lifeless Game Trailer Voice"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>This is the Lifeless Game Trailer Voice over. Not quite my <a href=\"/movie-trailer-voice\" title=\"Movie Trailer Voice\">movie trailer voice</a> but they wanted something American and dark. </p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[null,null]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Check out the video</h2>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I opted for a very close mic delivery and I think the end result is pretty cool. Video games are becoming more and more incredible and my <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Game Trailer Voice\">computer game trailer voice</a> is becoming a bigger part of my workload! The gaming industry is huge, so budgets are getting bigger, technology is getting more advanced and the game play is stunning. <br>I'm still proud to be working in this area of voice over.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dPuhuNi6NQw","title":"Lifeless Game Trailer Voice","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/lifeless-trailer-voice.jpg","alt":"Lifeless Game Trailer Voice","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Lifeless Game Trailer Voice"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>So, tell me more about Lifeless</h2>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Lifeless is set in May 2021, ten years have passed since patient zero. Ten years since the world turned into an infected wasteland... Two factions fight over resources, whilst battling an ever growing menace of infected humans. How will you choose to survive?<br> This is a great game and it's proving very popular. If it sounds like your cup of tea, make sure you check it out!</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Do you have an game or trailer in need of a powerful or deep voice for your <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">web or TV commercial</a>? Maybe a voice with impact like this Lifeless Game Trailer Voice? Please get in touch. To make the process even easier, just let me know the intended usage, and I can quote you more accurately. Send a short sample of the script and I'll send you a short audition. Check to see if my voice is right for your show or project. Please do get in touch today.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Lifeless Game Trailer Voice","pageUrl":"lifeless-game-trailer-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","920",{"href":"/just-eat-uefa-foo